WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Start with your local skills. Find the one you want to sync.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Open code-review to read the skill and its attachments.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:13.300
Choose the source skill and its destination, then preview the changes.

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:20.400
The current target is on the left, the source on the right. Compare before you decide.

5
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:28.500
The target changed. Preview again before syncing, rather than overwriting it.

6
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:36.000
Review the new differences. Existing edits are preserved until you approve replacement.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.100
Review the edits, approve replacement, and confirm the sync.

8
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.000
Sync complete. A copy of the previous target has been kept.

9
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.500
Switch to the destination to read the skill you just synced.

10
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:56.633
Open the activity log to see the sync record and find the preview-restore action.
